OL,3,GNEWSASports 'geo-blocking' can't be
OL,4,Astopped, says regulator
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe UK media regulator, Ofcom, has
OL,7,Fconcluded that the "geo-blocking" of
OL,8,FIrish sporting events in Northern
OL,9,FIreland is currently an insoluble
OL,10,Fproblem and may get worse.
OL,12,FGeo-blocking refers to the restriction
OL,13,Fof access to streamed content based on
OL,14,Fa viewer's geographical location.
OL,16,FIt means that sporting events on RTE
OL,17,Fand other Irish channels are frequently
OL,18,Funavailable to viewers in Northern
OL,19,FIreland.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,416,410,260,120,0,100
