OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSASports 'geo-blocking' can't be
OL,4,Astopped, says regulator
OL,5,
OL,6,FOfcom said it doesn't have the power to
OL,7,Fstop it and that there are no technical
OL,8,Fmeasures which offer "a complete,
OL,9,Flow-cost and universally applicable
OL,10,Fsolution".
